cat > pages/$file <<EOF
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>$title</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../css/${file%.html}.css"></head><body><div class="app"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="side-logo"><div class="side-mark">🌿</div><div class="side-brand"><strong>Hydrotech</strong><span>Dashboard Admin</span></div></div><nav class="nav"><a class="nav-item" href="hydrotech-dashboard-panel-2026.html">▦ Dashboard</a><a class="nav-item open" href="$file">⚙ $active</a><a class="nav-item" href="history.html">◷ History</a><a class="nav-item" href="profile.html">♟ Profile</a></nav><a class="logout" href="popup-logout.html">↳ Log out</a></aside><main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="page-title"><h1>$title</h1><p>Selamat datang kembali, Admin</p></div><div class="admin"><div class="bell">🔔</div><div class="admin-card"><div class="admin-a">A</div><div><div class="admin-name">Admin</div><div class="admin-email">admin@hydrotech.com</div></div></div></div></header><div class="content"><section class="hero"><div class="hero-left"><span class="hero-icon">⚙</span><div><h2>Setup $active</h2><p>Atur jadwal dan parameter $active agar sistem berjalan otomatis sesuai kebutuhan tanaman.</p></div></div><div class="hero-actions"><span>● Sistem Aktif</span><a class="edit-btn" href="input-$table.html">＋Edit data</a></div></section><section class="summary-grid"><div class="sum-card"><span class="si">♧</span><div><small>$minlabel</small><b>$minval</b></div></div><div class="sum-card"><span class="si">♧</span><div><small>$maxlabel</small><b>$maxval</b></div></div><div class="sum-card"><span class="si">◴</span><div><small>$lastlabel</small><b>$lastval</b></div></div><div class="sum-card"><span class="si">☰</span><div><small>Terakhir Diperbarui</small><b style="font-size:15px">5 Menit yang lalu</b></div></div></section><h2 class="table-title">Data Monitoring $active</h2><p class="table-sub">Riwayat aktivitas